`HttpResponse.make_bytes` only treats `bytes` specially, so a `memoryview` falls through to `str(value).encode`, producing the repr string. Also the `content` setter treats any iterable (including `memoryview`) as an iterator of chunks. Handling `memoryview`/`bytearray` as bytes-like in both places fixes the bug.

